sequenceDiagram
participant C as Cliente
participant G as API Gateway
participant A as Auth
participant O as Orders
participant I as Inventory
C->>G: POST /api/v1/orders (Bearer)
G->>A: Introspect token
A-->>G: user_id, role
G->>O: Crear pedido (identidad validada)
O->>I: GET /products/id
I-->>O: Precio/stock
O->>I: POST /reserve
alt Stock suficiente
I-->>O: reserved=true
O->>O: Guardar pedido pendiente
O-->>G: 201 pedido/total
G-->>C: 201 pedido/total
else Sin stock
I-->>O: 409
O-->>G: 409
G-->>C: 409
end
